<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.transcript.captures ~ one native source, the hook's own verb

`lares sense capture <transcript|stageDir> --wing <wing>` captures one native source into a wing of the sovereign sensorium through the daemon, `--session-id` naming its session. A `--room` other than the default room refuses, since the override has not landed. A failed stream leaves the source durable for a re-run. A leading sensorium name (`lares sense <sensorium> <verb>`) addresses any named sensorium; bare, the verb reads `memory`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ capture

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`capture` params=`target/session.jsonl wing/claude ~ capture one transcript`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ target · wing · session-id · room · sensorium-root

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`target` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<transcript|stageDir> ~ the transcript or stage dir`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wing` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the wing it lands in`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`session-id` params=`takes/id ~ the session it belongs to`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`room` params=`takes/name ~ refused unless the default room; the override has not landed`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium-root` params=`takes/host-path ~ the sensorium's root; the leading sensorium name threads it, absent the memory sensorium`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ rides the daemon's composed caps, the single-owner law; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · verb-error · capture-failed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.transcript.captures target/session.jsonl wing/claude]] ~ name the source and --wing`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ a --room override; drop it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`capture-failed` params=`cure/[[sense.transcript.captures target/session.jsonl wing/claude]] ~ a source stream failed; re-run once the daemon reports healthy`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ captured

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`captured` params=`exit/0 ~ the streams captured`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares sense capture

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares sense capture]] ~ the terminal`>>
